OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged with murder after     
OL,4,Afather fatally shot                    
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with murder  
OL,7,Fafter a father was shot dead in        
OL,8,FWolverhampton.                         
OL,10,FJermaine Smith, 30, died following a   
OL,11,Ffatal attack on Lilleshall Crescent in 
OL,12,Fthe early hours of 25 October 2025,    
OL,13,FWest Midlands Police said.             
OL,15,FTyler Bowen, 23, and Tristan Bent, 18, 
OL,16,Fboth from Wolverhampton, have been     
OL,17,Fcharged with murder and possession of a
OL,18,Ffirearm with intent to endanger life or
OL,19,Fenable another to do so.               
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
