OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged with murder after     
OL,4,Afather fatally shot                    
OL,6,FThey appeared at Wolverhampton         
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on Friday, were     
OL,8,Fremanded in custody and are due to     
OL,9,Fappear at the city's Crown Court on    
OL,10,FMonday.                                
